&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;A vehicle modification/accessory to add to your post-apocalyptic or otherwise ramshackle vehicles.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;There is a 1mm hole running through the vertical chain and the ball so that it can be pinned with a paperclip for added durability.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Currently scaled for around 1/72 or 15-20mm scale, will probably need to be scaled up for 28mm miniatures (and a bigger pin found!).
